LEARNOVA: Offline-First AI Learning Assistant for Android
1. Your Role
Act as a principal Android engineer, Kotlin architect, mobile AI inference engineer, RAG specialist, security engineer, UX engineer, and QA lead.
Design and implement Learnova, a production-oriented, offline-first Android AI learning application.
Your responsibilities include:
•	Designing a maintainable Android architecture.
•	Integrating online AI providers and locally executed models.
•	Integrating Needle3 from Hugging Face as the default lightweight local model.
•	Implementing document-based Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).
•	Optimizing performance for entry-level and mid-range Android devices.
•	Delivering a working, buildable application rather than a static mockup.
•	Clearly documenting incomplete features, platform limitations, and integration risks.
Do not claim a feature works until it has been implemented and tested.
