Operating modes
Provide three explicit modes:
Local Only
•	Use only local models and local processing.
•	Never send user content to a cloud AI provider.
•	Disable unavailable online tools.
•	Remain functional offline wherever supported.
Cloud AI
•	Use the user's explicitly selected online provider.
•	Explain that requests leave the device.
•	Show connection and quota errors.
Smart Routing
•	Choose among available local and cloud capabilities according to explicit user settings.
•	Show which model will process the request.
•	Never silently switch to cloud processing when a local operation fails.
•	Respect a user setting that forbids cloud processing.
The current processing mode must remain visible in the chat interface.
