19. Required MVP Acceptance Criteria
The MVP is not complete until the following core paths work:
1.	The app builds successfully.
2.	A user can open the app and create a workspace.
3.	A user can configure at least one working cloud provider.
4.	A user can download and install a verified compatible local model.
