14.	A user can export an actual DOCX or PDF.
15.	Failures produce understandable messages and do not crash the app.
16.	The app provides a reproducible build and setup guide.
If Needle3 integration is blocked by a genuine runtime limitation, report the exact blocker, evidence, and next steps. Do not claim that acceptance criterion 5 or 6 has passed.
